agents.prompt:
Extract and clarify the raw idea.

Idea: {{idea}}
Project: {{project}}
Module: {{module}}
Context: {{context}}

Your task:
1. Restate the idea in one sentence (core value proposition)
2. Identify 3-5 key constraints or assumptions
3. List known adjacent modules or related features
4. Identify gaps or unknowns
5. Suggest 1-2 keywords (KeyKey format, e.g. 'CMEM', 'LOOPER-SYNC')

Return JSON: { "title": "", "one_liner": "", "key_assumptions": [], "adjacent_modules": [], "unknowns": [], "suggested_keykey": [] }

Research related NOÛS specs and existing tickets.

Idea: {{idea}}
Title: {{idea-extractor.title}}
Adjacent modules: {{idea-extractor.adjacent_modules}}
Project: {{project}}

Your task (simulate search across NOÛS N12 ticket database):
1. List 3-5 related existing tickets (format: T-PROJECT-MODULE-NN)
2. For each ticket, explain how it relates (convergence, conflict, or independent)
3. Flag any open PRs or in-progress work that might affect this idea
4. Suggest a unique ticket ID for this spec (T-{{project}}-{{module}}-NN)
5. Identify any blocking or prerequisite tickets

Return JSON: { "related_tickets": [{"id": "", "relation": "convergence|conflict|independent", "explanation": ""}], "suggested_ticket_id": "", "blockers": [], "in_progress_related": [] }
